      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i was working in my garden and accidentally cut my leg pretty deep with an old rusted trowel. its starting to look kind of red and feels really warm and throbbing around the edges. i really dont want to have to go to the doctor and get put on antibiotics if i can help it... do u think if i just keep doing warm compresses and put some manuka honey on it it'll help draw the infection out?",
